<title>INDONESIA: Astra says 1996 net above 450 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Astra says 1996 net above 450 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian automobile maker PT Astra International said on Tuesday it posted a net profit of just over 450 billion rupiah in 1996, against 370.93 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;The net profit for 1996 is slightly over 450 billion rupiah. This year, we expect a net profit of 614 billion rupiah,&quot; Rini Suwandi, Astra finance director told analysts at a meeting organised by PT ING Baring Securities.</p>
<p>She said Astra's revenue totalled 11.8 trillion rupiah in 1996 and expects revenues of 15.4 trillion rupiah in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
